WEBVTT

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:13.360
Bye Momo, Gramps! I'm off!

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:14.950
Take care!

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:17.620
Have fun at the summer camp!

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.580
Will do!

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:23.670
See you!

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:26.210
Do your best, okay?

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:31.460
Now then, it's time for us to begin the operation!

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.720
Are we really going to do this, Gramps?

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.890
Just who the hell do you think I am, Private Momo?

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:26.370
Welcome to Shikine Island
Welcome to Shikine Island

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:31.080
We're finally here!

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:35.380
The sea out here is a totally different color than the one back home!

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:39.470
We're about fifty kilometers from Ooshima.

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:41.640
It's so hot...

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:45.060
We're lucky the weather's so nice.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:56.530
Everyone head out to the dormitory!

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:58.360
Yes ma'am!

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.110
The sea's so pretty!

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:01.570
I should've gotten a new bikini...

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:05.660
Isshiki! Futaba! Saegusa! Shinomiya! Come here for a moment.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.160
Yes?

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:10.580
Give me your Operation Keys.

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:11.290
Huh?

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.540
I'll be taking care of all your Keys.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:15.920
Why?

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:19.380
The safety of the world depends on them.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.630
What if you lost them in the sea or something?

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:22.550
I see...

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:25.600
That's a good idea, Ms. Mizuha.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.560
Please take care of them!

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:32.900
I'll be keeping them safe until the summer camp ends.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.400
Go on then!

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:38.070
We're going!

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.860
Valkyrie 1 to Wild Weasel.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.410
This is Valkyrie 1 speaking.

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:45.700
Respond, Wild Weasel.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:48.910
Wild Weasel to Valkyrie 1.

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:50.410
I hear you loud and clear.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:55.670
Reporting in. I've collected their Operation Keys just as planned.

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:57.040
Understood.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.170
Commence the operation then.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:05.930
Dr. Isshiki, will this <i>really</i> help the girls?

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:07.560
Of course it will!

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:14.600
This summer camp is the best opportunity for them to increase their power of friendship.

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:18.940
Just watch! My training operation is perfect!

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:20.610
Y-Yes...

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.360
Training operation, huh?

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.920
Himawari, your bikini's so cute!

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.210
It looks great on you!

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.300
Oh, well...

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.590
See, I told you!

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:45.800
Y-Yeah...

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.720
Hm, what's up?

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:52.270
We bought these together the other day.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.270
With Wakaba?

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:59.320
She said she had no swimsuit, so I thought I could lend her one, but...

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:05.240
Yeah, I don't think she could fit into your swimsuits...

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:07.280
Wow, they're so soft!

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.990
Hey, Akane! Stop that!

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.280
Are you even listening?

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:23.050
This summer camp is also part of your curriculum.

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:25.260
By cleaning the beach,

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:30.760
you'll gain awareness about environmental protection and learn to appreciate nature's beauty!

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:33.770
All units, deploy!

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:40.650
Pick that up!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:43.780
I wonder where this came from.

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:52.910
Alkyldiphenyloxide Disulfonate is an excellent additive to improve cold water efficacy.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.040
That's what it says.

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:55.660
Huh?

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:07.680
Ah, Rei!

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:11.850
Leave me alone.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.190
What's wrong, Akane?

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.860
It's nothing...

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:32.740
Isshiki Akane... Why does she keep following me?

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.370
You can't get out, can you?

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.130
What the—

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:57.770
What are you doing, Gramps?

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:01.150
She's just taking a nap.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:03.770
We wouldn't want her making a fuss now.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:07.230
But she's Akane's classmate!

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:10.660
So what? We just gotta play it by ear.

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:11.780
Play it by ear?

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:15.700
We'll get her to help with the girls' training too.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:20.210
That'll make it more realistic and efficient!

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:22.040
Not like we have a choice now...

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.630
But you'll have to apologize to her properly later.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.260
I found a bottle!

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:38.810
"No push"?

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.230
Safety released.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:47.360
Launching molecular transformation system.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:47.940
Wait, what? Wh-What?!

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.610
Five. Four. Three. Two. One.
Wait, what? Wh-What?!

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:49.690
What did you do?

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:50.860
Five. Four. Three. Two. One.

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:50.950
Akane?

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:52.860
Five. Four. Three. Two. One.

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.540
I... didn't see that coming.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:00.000
Akane, are you okay?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.500
Yeah, I'm fine!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.170
What's this?

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.090
Some tent?

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:07.590
It looks like it!

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:10.630
My grandpa made me this swimsuit,

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:14.220
but I didn't know it could do stuff like this!

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.680
Dr. Isshiki invented it?

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.350
It's awesome!

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:20.730
Let's try going in.

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:21.640
Then...

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:22.480
Me too...

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.190
Excuse us!

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:26.480
I wanna go in too!

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.530
Hey!

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.740
How is it?

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:33.110
Hey!

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:34.990
Huh?

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:37.030
What's wrong?

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:39.790
Akane, are you chilly?

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:49.420
Ah, sorry...

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:53.300
Look!

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.050
What's that?

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:57.340
My name is Alan!

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:58.600
Alone?!

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.100
It spoke!

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.470
Okay then!

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:05.060
Oh yeah, Ms. Mizuha has our Operation Keys!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.320
We've kidnapped this girl!

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:11.650
Rei!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:12.860
Kuroki!

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:13.690
Why?!

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:19.200
If you want her back, get into that boat right now!

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:26.620
But do you have the courage to oppose us?

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.050
It's obviously a trap.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:33.210
What should we do?

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:34.840
Isn't it obvious?

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:38.590
Even if it's a trap, we've gotta save Rei!

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:51.360
Hold on, Rei!

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.750
All preparations complete.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.050
Commence operation!

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.550
Rei!

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:22.220
Kuroki!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:23.430
Hey!

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.480
Kuroki, where are you?

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:30.310
So there's an island out here...

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.770
I wonder where Rei is.

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:35.780
Um, I think it might be this way.

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:37.700
Secret Alone
Base This Way

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:41.370
Guess it's that way...

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:46.370
We'll have to stick together and try to not get seperated.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:51.250
We don't know what traps may lie ahead of us.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:00.090
Wow, what a pretty bug!

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:03.720
It's a type of scarab beetle. Its scientific name is Immaculicullis.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.680
Immaculi-what?!

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:13.980
Wakaba, could it be that you're afraid of bugs?

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:17.190
Oh come on, they're just bugs!

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.240
An Alone!

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:24.830
Leave it to me!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:29.710
By the name of the Natural Harmony School, I'll protect everyone!

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:35.130
Natural Harmony Technique!

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:37.840
Bug Smiter!

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:51.020
You're amazing, Wakaba!

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:52.730
You really are a sword master!

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:55.480
Nothing can stand in the way of Natural Harmony!

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.480
It's amazing!

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:00.900
Don't push
Just how strong are you?!

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:00.950
Don't push
So cool!
Just how strong are you?!

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:01.490
So cool!
Don't push

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:02.530
So cool!

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:10.870
Bugs!

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:13.710
No! Bugs!

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:15.880
No bugs!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:21.550
Those aren't real bugs. They're probably spy droids.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:28.560
They took off...

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.110
Akane...

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:39.360
What're you doing?!

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:43.110
You should be complementing each other's weaknesses!

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:46.910
Friendship is the key to the true power of the Vivid System!

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:49.160
Way to blow it...

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:05.930
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:20.940
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:24.950
<i>Did they find out who I am?</i>

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.830
Wakaba!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.830
Himawari!

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:43.050
What should we do? We've lost them...

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:46.840
I'm sure they're heading to the secret Alone base too!

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:48.050
That's right!

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:49.260
Let's hurry!

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:50.050
Yeah!

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:57.980
Uh... we're totally lost!

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:58.810
Um...

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:01.440
Could you put me down?

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.150
Sorry!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.280
Let's go to the Alone base.

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:10.530
The others will be heading there too.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:16.660
Show me the power of your friendship!

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:21.130
Good luck, Akane!

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:22.750
Here we go!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.550
Aoi!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:32.890
Akane!

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:43.570
I guess we're safe now.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:51.240
It's coming back!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.740
Is this the doing of the Alones too?

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.960
What will you do now, Akane?

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:01.460
What?

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.090
Akane, we're at a dead end!

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:18.600
It popped?

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.270
A balloon?

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:24.270
Get out of here. Quickly.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:32.700
<i>Wasn't that...</i>

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:36.450
So cool! Who was that?

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:40.160
What's up with this trail?

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:42.670
It's like a conveyor belt!

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:45.250
How long will this go on!

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.680
I... can't...

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:01.810
You mustn't give up!

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:07.900
Himawari!

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:10.650
Wakaba!

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.920
Thank goodness!

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:27.170
Leave this island. Now.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:31.800
Wakaba, was that...

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.680
Yeah, I think so.

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:37.430
<i>I didn't save them because I wanted to.</i>

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:40.220
<i>It was necessary for my escape.</i>

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.650
Why is this happening at such a critical moment?!<i></i>

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:47.440
Damn useless technology!

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.320
Gramps, stop it already!

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:51.740
Not yet!

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:56.910
It's time for me to get serious and strike back at full force!

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.830
Full force? What do you mean?

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:08.590
I wonder if they'll find the true power of friendship and overcome this trial?

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:11.340
Let's do this!

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:17.840
Armored melee robot, Bearoid Mk. III, launch!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:26.270
How much longer?

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:29.150
How much longer, Aoi?

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:37.240
So you've finally appeared, Alone!

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.990
Wait! Over here!

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:41.330
Aoi!

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:51.340
What was that?

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:52.380
Let's check it out!

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:55.550
Akane!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:56.220
We found you.

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:57.630
Wakaba!

00:17:57.630 --> 00:17:58.590
Himawari!

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:00.760
What was that sound just now?

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:03.310
Aoi...

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:11.900
That was so scary...

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:18.450
My Bearoid...

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:22.910
Aoi's gotten so strong!

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:25.250
Damn you!

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:27.790
Don't get cocky, girls!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:29.170
Gramps!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.960
Don't you underestimate Isshiki Kenjirou!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.340
Let's do this!

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:37.300
Where are you going, Gramps?

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:42.140
System install!

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.970
FCS online!

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:45.890
APO separated!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:49.390
Critical power charged!

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:54.400
Catapult contact!

00:18:57.240 --> 00:19:00.240
I'll show you what an adult is like when they get serious!

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:04.620
You're not acting like an adult whatsoever, Gramps.

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:08.210
Pallet Suit Prototype, launch!

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:10.620
We're here!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.580
Come out, Alone!

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.380
Give Rei back!

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:17.300
Something appeared!

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:21.300
I'm impressed you made it here.

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:26.310
But this is the first sphere of Hell, the place where you die!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.900
What's that?! So cool!

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:35.320
Give back Rei, you darn Alone!

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.870
Nothing happened...

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:49.580
They're all balloons...

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:54.920
Alone, your attacks don't work!

00:19:58.590 --> 00:19:59.800
You again?

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:03.550
What are you doing? I told you to escape!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:08.060
We can't! We're here to save our friend!

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:10.230
Friend?

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.190
You're mine!

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:20.820
Delta-X Hyper Random Energy Focus!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:22.900
Push it, Aoi!

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:24.410
Okay!

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:27.530
Safety released.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.410
Launching system.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:32.710
Five. Four. Three.

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:33.750
Two.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:34.790
One.

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:37.840
Fire!

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.590
Wh-What?!

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:03.950
Akane, are you okay?

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:06.360
N-Not okay...

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:08.030
She seems okay.

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:09.280
I'm so glad!

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:12.080
Huh?

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:13.160
Where'd she go?

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:26.260
That was all Gramps' doing?!

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:30.260
I'm very sorry for the trouble we caused.

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:32.470
Gramps, say you're sorry too!

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:35.230
Why should I apologize for—

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:36.480
Say sorry!

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:37.270
I'm sowwy.

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:47.570
Kuroki...

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:54.540
We're sorry you got caught up in that prank by Akane's grandfather.

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:57.540
We got out alive thanks to you.

00:21:57.540 --> 00:22:00.130
Thank you.

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:03.920
I-I don't know what you're talking about.

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:11.430
What a weirdo.

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:14.350
Girls! What's wrong?

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:20.310
Look at that, Mizuha!

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:26.820
Due to the training, the girls are now connected by even stronger bonds!

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:30.410
Friendship is magic.

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:32.660
Yes, that's right.

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:36.540
However, this is the bill for the costs of the operation.

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:39.960
What?! I... uh...

00:22:40.460 --> 00:22:42.170
Put it on my tab, please.

00:24:14.010 --> 00:24:15.600
